      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "9432edd09adebe67618cbed8f0b7104b7066f28679aa9e1d788ab9caa912873b",
      "text": "10 February · Breakfast and transfer to the airport for your flight to Foz do Iguaçu; your guide meets you and takes you to the Belmond Hotel das Cataratas, Junior Suite, the only hotel inside the national park on the Brazilian side. A full programme: the Brazilian side of the falls, where some 275 cascades plunge into the Devil’s Throat amid rainbows and spray; the Macuco Safari by private boat, through the jungle by open jeep, then by motorboat right up to the falls; a 10-minute private helicopter flight over the falls; and the Bird Park, with its walk-through aviaries.\n\nAccommodation: Belmond Hotel das Cataratas, Junior Suite, breakfast",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1tC7yeDbT5HiCCrM2epBBJXPxLcqSDlXd",
